      "to": "A woman reported her backpack stolen from an S19 train in the early hours of 17 October. She could locate her headphones at Cologne Central Station; a man carrying the backpack was later found near Breslauer Platz. Most belongings were returned, but the teacher’s students’ tests remained missing. The exact train segment where the theft occurred is not stated.",
